   "stem_html": "<p>Which of the following is true about the graphs of <span data-math=\"f(x)\">f(x)</span> and <span data-math=\"g(x)\">g(x)</span> below?</p>\n<p><img alt=\"GRAPH OF TWO FUNCTIONS. ONE IS A PARABOLA THAT OPENS UP. THE OTHER IS A LINE WITH A NEGATIVE SLOPE. THE FUNCTIONS INTERSECT AT THE POINTS (1, −3) AND (−2, 0).\n\" src=\"exercises/media/05bc9fdd7ca98db0.jpg\" width=\"300\"></p>",
